# What does NOT go into the build context.
#
# CAREFUL with /data: the Dockerfile runs `npm run import:corpus`, which needs the CSVs,
# reglas_damana.xlsx and the formato_elicitacion*.xlsx files. Only the database
# (regenerated inside) and the working Excel files nobody reads at build time are excluded.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
backend/public
.angular
.git
.github
e2e
test-results
playwright-report
evaluations
coverage
data/corpus.db
data/corpus.db-shm
data/corpus.db-wal
data/por_traducir_*.xlsx
data/dudas_para_hablantes_*.xlsx
.env
.env.*
**/.env

# Raw external sources (PDF, extracted text, reports): neither the importer
# nor the runtime reads them; they weigh ~8 MB.
material-externo
